{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "tawseela-api-full-v2",
    "name": "Tawseela API — full (Railway)",
    "description": "Production base: `https://tawseela-production.up.railway.app` (local: `http://localhost:8099`)\n\n**Suggested order**\n1. **01 — Register (Customer)** → then **03 — Login**\n2. **02 — Register (Driver)** → verify → admin approves in **08 — Admin**\n3. **09 — Delivery v1** — profiles, drivers runtime, orders, notifications\n4. **05 — Forgot password** (alternate path)\n5. **04 — OTP (public)** optional resend/verify by purpose\n6. **GET /api/auth/me** — current user (all roles)\n7. **08 — Admin**\n8. **10 — API docs** — Swagger UI / OpenAPI JSON (public)\n\n**OTP:** fixed `1234` while `tawseela.otp.fixed-code` is set.\n\n**Variables:** `accessToken` from login; v1 saves `orderId`, `profileId`, `driverUserId`, `notificationId` from responses.\n\n**Cron / service:** `X-Cron-Secret`, `X-Service-Secret` (see collection variables).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "https://tawseela-production.up.railway.app" },
    { "key": "mobileNumber", "value": "+15550001111" },
    { "key": "driverMobileNumber", "value": "+15550002222" },
    { "key": "adminMobile", "value": "admin" },
    { "key": "adminPassword", "value": "ChangeMe1!Strong" },
    { "key": "password", "value": "Str0ng!Pass" },
    { "key": "otpCode", "value": "1234" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "resetToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "driverProfileId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "profileId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "driverUserId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "orderId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "notificationId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "cronSecret", "value": "change-me-cron-secret" },
    { "key": "serviceSecret", "value": "change-me-service-secret" },
    { "key": "metricsDate", "value": "2026-05-23" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 — Register (Customer)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Register — CUSTOMER",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"Ada\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Customer\",\n  \"mobileNumber\": \"{{mobileNumber}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"confirmPassword\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"role\": \"CUSTOMER\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
            "description": "Creates user; sends OTP. Customer is enabled after verify."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Register verify — CUSTOMER",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.tokens) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.data.tokens.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.data.tokens.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mobileNumber\": \"{{mobileNumber}}\",\n  \"otpCode\": \"{{otpCode}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register/verify",
            "description": "Returns tokens in `data.tokens`. Saves access/refresh to collection variables."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 — Register (Driver)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Register — DRIVER",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"firstName\": \"Bob\",\n  \"lastName\": \"Driver\",\n  \"mobileNumber\": \"{{driverMobileNumber}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"confirmPassword\": \"{{password}}\",\n  \"role\": \"DRIVER\",\n  \"vehicleType\": \"Sedan\",\n  \"vehicleNumber\": \"ABC-1234\",\n  \"licenseNumber\": \"DL-987654\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
            "description": "Driver account disabled until admin approves after OTP verify."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Register verify — DRIVER",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.tokens) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.data.tokens.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.data.tokens.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mobileNumber\": \"{{driverMobileNumber}}\",\n  \"otpCode\": \"{{otpCode}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register/verify"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "03 — Login & session",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.data.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.data.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mobileNumber\": \"{{mobileNumber}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
            "description": "Change `mobileNumber` to `{{driverMobileNumber}}` or `{{adminMobile}}` for other roles."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Login — admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.data.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.data.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mobileNumber\": \"{{adminMobile}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2b. Login — driver",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.data.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.data.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mobileNumber\": \"{{driverMobileNumber}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
            "description": "Driver must be OTP-verified and admin-approved."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Refresh token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.accessToken) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.data.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.data.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh-token"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout",
            "description": "Requires Bearer access token + refresh token in body."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5. GET /api/auth/me",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.userId) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('profileId', res.data.userId);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me",
            "description": "Unified current-user endpoint for all roles. Auto-provisions delivery profile if missing. Saves `profileId` (userId)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6. PATCH /api/auth/me/driver-profile (driver)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"vehicleType\": \"SUV\",\n  \"vehicleNumber\": \"XYZ-9999\",\n  \"licenseNumber\": \"DL-111222\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me/driver-profile",
            "description": "Update driver vehicle details. Requires DRIVER role and approved login token."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "04 — OTP (public)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "OTP send — REGISTER",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mobileNumber\": \"{{mobileNumber}}\",\n  \"purpose\": \"REGISTER\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/otp/send"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "OTP send — LOGIN",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mobileNumber\": \"{{mobileNumber}}\",\n  \"purpose\": \"LOGIN\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/otp/send"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "OTP send — FORGET_PASSWORD",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mobileNumber\": \"{{mobileNumber}}\",\n  \"purpose\": \"FORGET_PASSWORD\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/otp/send"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "OTP verify — REGISTER",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.registration && res.data.registration.tokens) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', res.data.registration.tokens.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', res.data.registration.tokens.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mobileNumber\": \"{{mobileNumber}}\",\n  \"otpCode\": \"{{otpCode}}\",\n  \"purpose\": \"REGISTER\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/otp/verify"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "OTP verify — LOGIN",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mobileNumber\": \"{{mobileNumber}}\",\n  \"otpCode\": \"{{otpCode}}\",\n  \"purpose\": \"LOGIN\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/otp/verify",
            "description": "Sets `data.loginOtpVerified` when successful."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "OTP verify — FORGET_PASSWORD",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.forgotPassword && res.data.forgotPassword.resetToken) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('resetToken', res.data.forgotPassword.resetToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mobileNumber\": \"{{mobileNumber}}\",\n  \"otpCode\": \"{{otpCode}}\",\n  \"purpose\": \"FORGET_PASSWORD\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/otp/verify"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "05 — Forgot password",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Send OTP",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mobileNumber\": \"{{mobileNumber}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password/send-otp"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Verify OTP",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.resetToken) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('resetToken', res.data.resetToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mobileNumber\": \"{{mobileNumber}}\",\n  \"otpCode\": \"{{otpCode}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password/verify-otp"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Reset password",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"mobileNumber\": \"{{mobileNumber}}\",\n  \"resetToken\": \"{{resetToken}}\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"N3w!Str0ng\",\n  \"confirmPassword\": \"N3w!Str0ng\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/forgot-password/reset"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "08 — Admin (role ADMIN)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/admin/users",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/users",
            "description": "Use token from **03 — Login — admin**."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/admin/drivers",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.success && Array.isArray(res.data) && res.data.length > 0) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('driverProfileId', res.data[0].driverProfileId);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/drivers",
            "description": "Saves first `driverProfileId` to collection variable for approve/reject."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT /api/admin/drivers/{id}/approve",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/drivers/{{driverProfileId}}/approve"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT /api/admin/drivers/{id}/reject",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/drivers/{{driverProfileId}}/reject"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "09 — Delivery API v1",
      "description": "Requires JWT from **03 — Login** (role must match each request). Run admin login before assign order; driver login before accept flow.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Profiles",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "GET /api/v1/profiles (admin)",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profiles?role=CUSTOMER&page=0&size=20",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "profiles"],
                  "query": [
                    { "key": "role", "value": "CUSTOMER" },
                    { "key": "page", "value": "0" },
                    { "key": "size", "value": "20" }
                  ]
                },
                "description": "Admin only. Optional `role`: CUSTOMER, DRIVER, ADMIN."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "GET /api/v1/profiles (admin) — DRIVER",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profiles?role=DRIVER&page=0&size=20",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "profiles"],
                  "query": [
                    { "key": "role", "value": "DRIVER" },
                    { "key": "page", "value": "0" },
                    { "key": "size", "value": "20" }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "GET /api/v1/profiles/{id}",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profiles/{{profileId}}"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "POST /api/v1/profiles",
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"fullName\": \"Ada Customer\",\n  \"phone\": \"{{mobileNumber}}\"\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profiles",
                "description": "409 if profile already exists (V4 backfill or /auth/me)."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "PATCH /api/v1/profiles/{id} — FCM token",
              "request": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"fcmToken\": \"test-fcm-device-token\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Ada Customer\"\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/profiles/{{profileId}}"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Drivers (runtime)",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "POST /api/v1/drivers",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "const res = pm.response.json();",
                      "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.id) {",
                      "  pm.collectionVariables.set('driverUserId', res.data.id);",
                      "}"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/drivers",
                "description": "Driver role. Creates `drivers` row (login as driver after admin approve)."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "GET /api/v1/drivers",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/drivers?isOnline=true&page=0&size=20",
                  "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "drivers"],
                  "query": [
                    { "key": "isOnline", "value": "true" },
                    { "key": "page", "value": "0" },
                    { "key": "size", "value": "20" }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "GET /api/v1/drivers/{id}",
              "request": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }],
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/drivers/{{driverUserId}}"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "PATCH /api/v1/drivers/{id} — go online",
              "request": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"online\": true,\n  \"currentLat\": 36.737232,\n  \"currentLng\": 3.086472\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/drivers/{{driverUserId}}",
                "description": "Own driver id only."
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "PATCH /api/v1/drivers/{id} — go offline",
              "request": {
                "method": "PATCH",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"online\": false\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/drivers/{{driverUserId}}"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Orders — Customer",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "POST /api/v1/orders",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "type": "text/javascript",
                    "exec": [
                      "const res = pm.response.json();",
                      "if (res.success && res.data && res.data.id) {",
                      "  pm.collectionVariables.set('orderId', res.data.id);",
                      "}"
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                  { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{accessToken}}" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"description\": \"Buy medicine from pharmacy\",\n  \"deliveryLat\": 36.737232,\n  \"deliveryLng\": 3.086472,\n  \"deliveryAddress\": \"12 Rue Didouche Mourad, Alger\"\n}"
                },
                "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders",
                "description": "Customer role. Saves `orderId`."
              }
            },
